sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Refund request A
  participant B as Refund request B
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  A->>D: Begin; idempotency key; lock payment
  B->>D: Begin; different key; wait for same payment lock
  A->>D: Reserve 20000 from 25000 available
  A->>D: Insert refund and operation and outbox; commit
  D-->>B: Acquire payment lock; see 5000 available
  B->>D: Reject 20000 request; rollback
  Note over A,D: UNKNOWN keeps reservation
  Note over A,D: Success atomically moves reserved to refunded and posts journal
